# Smart Search Patterns

Documents and enforces bounded search patterns to avoid infinite loops and resource waste.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Using `codebase_search`, `grep`, or other search tools
- Finding files or patterns
- Searching for information
- Need to locate code or documentation

