## Exceptions

When this rule doesn't apply:
- Some exploratory searches may need broader patterns
- Discovery searches may need less filtering

## Checklist

Before executing search, verify:
- Query is specific and bounded
- Limits are set appropriately
- Filters are applied when needed
- No infinite loop risk
- Multiple methods combined if needed

